'''Pachirisu ex''' (Japanese: '''パチリスex''' ''Pachirisu ex'') is a {{ct|Lightning}} Basic {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

